                "path": "mcp_template",
                "instructions": "Set of tools to manage todo items. \n- get_todo: tool to retrieve a specific todo item. \n- get_active: tool to retrieve all active todo items.\n- get_all: tool to retrieve all todo items. \n- create_todo: tool to add or replace a todo item. \n- set_todo_completed: tool to change the status of a todo item as completed. \n\nTodo items use jsonld schema.org Action properties. \nTo update a todo, you should first get it from the list in order to get the proper @id value."
